From 5604f50ef21f40d4268a6e1103082af2425fbf28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:03:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] expert_pack: DeepSeek-V4 MTP (NextN) draft on the shared
 expert-pack store

- ExpertPackStore: optional 1-layer MTP pack (mtp_pack_path/mtp_manifest_path)
  indexed as logical layer num_layers, read through its own fd; probe/close aware.
- ExpertPackMoEMethod: the NextN decoder's FusedMoE (prefix model.decoder.*)
  maps to the MTP layer id.
- ExpertPackModelLoader: draft (is_draft_model) path loads
  DeepseekV4ForCausalLMNextN with the target's store, Q8_0 dense tensors from
  mtp-dense.safetensors, and shares the target's GGUF embedding/lm_head.
- decode_token_threshold: speculative verify rows (<= num_draft_tokens) are
  classified as decode for the tier policy.
- tests: attached MTP pack read/validation (31 tests pass).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
